python-orjson (3.13.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Team upload.
  * New upstream release.
  * Build against pyo3 0.28 available in Debian.
  * Do not enable zmij's no-panic feature (unavailable in Debian).
  * Look up Python 3.15's frozendict type via builtins.
  * Remove defaults from debian/control.
  * Update Standards-Version.
  * Update to debhelper compatibility level 14.
  * Add dh-sequence-single-binary.
  * Add lintian overrides for the Rust-built extension modules.

 -- Edward Betts <edward@4angle.com>  Wed, 28 Oct 2026 09:08:06 +0000

