python-orjson (3.11.7-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Team upload.
  * New upstream version
  * d/copyright: new upstream license: MPL-2 (with some files also as Expat).
  * Standards-Version: 4.7.3 (routine-update)
  * Refreshed remove-unwinding-feature.patch
  * Added patch to allow for building with older version of the pyo3
    crates.
  * Added patch to remove the no-panic feature as it is unsupported by
    the Debian package for the "zmij" crate.
  * d/control: add explicit deps on librust-zmij-dev & librust-pyo3-
    build-config-dev.

